OL,3,GNEWSAYoung child injured by firework on
OL,4,AHalloween night
OL,5,
OL,6,FA toddler was taken to hospital after
OL,7,Fbeing burnt by a firework in County
OL,8,FTyrone on Halloween night.
OL,10,FIt was one of numerous
OL,11,FHalloween-related incidents that the
OL,12,Femergency services responded to across
OL,13,FNorthern Ireland on Saturday night and
OL,14,Finto Sunday.
OL,16,FFireworks were deliberately directed at
OL,17,Ffire crews in six separate incidents.
OL,19,FThe injury to the toddler - a girl
OL,20,Funder two years old - happened outside
OL,21,Fa filling station on Main Street in
OL,22,FCarrickmore at about 20:30 GMT.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
